+/// Whether a support code's answer brings a `staff` this PC holds (the doc 3-7 지원 확인, as the
+/// process that registers checks it in keep_guest_pc): none, or one refused there, gives P2's
+/// toast, not P6.
+#[cfg(not(any(target_os = "android", target_os = "ios")))]
+fn holds_staff(answer: &Value, pinned: &[(u32, [u8; 32])], device: &Device, now: u64) -> bool {
+    answer.get("staff").is_some_and(|staff| {
+        crate::hjviewer_account::verify_grant(pinned, staff, &device.id, &device.pk, now).is_ok()
+    })
+}
